            "slot": "s1479",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · I am the most skeptical person when it…",
            "text": "I am the most skeptical person when it comes to products, which never stops me from trying them. I usually by them and try for a few weeks and when I don't get magical results I give up. I also hate that most hair growth products make your hair greasy or just dirty looking. It's going to sound crazy, but I feel like using this at night actually extends the life of my hai wash/blow out, and gives it some extra body too. quite the incentive to keep up with my routine. Beyond those things and I am on month 2, I do see less shedding and more hair growth both in my part and other areas of less denstiy as well as around the hair line. I am using other products from K18 and really love them all!",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
