            "text": "​⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Truly transformative for perimenopause scalp changes & insane regrowth!​Switching to the K18 Peptide Prep Detox Shampoo and FutureIQ Scalp Serum has been a total game-changer. The hot flashes from perimenopause were leaving dried sweat salts and buildup that made my scalp feel suffocated, parched, and constantly tight.​The Detox gently dissolves all that dried residue without stripping my barrier, and the serum provides pure, weightless hydration directly to the skin bed 🫧​The regrowth spurt has been unreal. The density at the follicle level is wild!! So many thick, strong new strands poking through all across my crown and down to the nape of my neck 🌱✨ My scalp can finally breathe again and feels completely calm and weightless 🪶 10/10 worth every single penny!",
